sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Demonstration participant
  participant Sensor as AS608
  participant ESP as ESP32
  participant RTC as DS3231
  participant Queue as LittleFS queue
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant UI as Dashboard

  User->>Sensor: Place finger
  Sensor->>Sensor: Capture and compare on-module
  alt Match found
    Sensor-->>ESP: Slot ID and sensor result
    ESP->>RTC: Read configured local time
    RTC-->>ESP: Date/time; firmware applies configured timezone offset
    ESP->>ESP: Create persistent event UUID
    alt API reachable
      ESP->>API: POST event with same UUID on retries
      API->>DB: Transaction: idempotency, slot resolve, 60-second check, insert outcome
      DB-->>API: RECORDED or DUPLICATE_SUPPRESSED
      API-->>ESP: Stored outcome
      ESP-->>User: Generic confirmed outcome; no identity shown
    else Offline
      ESP->>Queue: Persist event before acknowledging queued state
      ESP-->>User: Show "Saved offline" only after durable write
      Note over ESP,Queue: On reconnect, replay oldest first; remove only after accepted server response
      ESP->>API: Replay event with original capture time and UUID
      API->>DB: Transaction: idempotency, slot resolve, 60-second check, insert outcome
      DB-->>API: RECORDED or DUPLICATE_SUPPRESSED
      API-->>ESP: Stored outcome; firmware may now remove queued event
    end
    API-->>UI: Authenticated SSE committed event
    UI->>API: REST fetch attendance/report data
  else No match
    Sensor-->>ESP: No-match result
    ESP-->>User: Generic failure prompt; do not reveal another student's identity
  end
